      "en": "Peter answered her, “Tell me whether you sold the land for so much.” She said, “Yes, for so much.”",
      "ko": "베드로가 가로되 그 땅 판 값이 이것 뿐이냐 내게 말하라 하니 가로되 예 이뿐이로라",
      "source_text_hash": "0db4ab89c91f07eef1624efd12348aa0cb866cede6faa7416c494d6b0cc3d863",
      "translation_text_hash": "2845564830d7004b39a8baab869eb5eb806625e3615adcbea8b1dc0a9256362b",
